[6.209976, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[6.214985, "o", "Gopher-Ops-Toolkit: 一个运维工具箱\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  gopt [command]\r\n\r\nAvailable Commands:\r\n  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell\r\n  exec        A brief description of your command\r\n  health      检查服务的健康状态\r\n  help        Help about any command\r\n  log         A brief description of your command\r\n  monitor     A brief description of your command\r\n  version     Print the version number\r\n\r\nFlags:\r\n      --config string    config file (default: ~/.config/gopt/config.yaml)\r\n  -h, --help             help for gopt\r\n      --log-dir string   日志文件保存目录 (default \"/home/k3s/.local/share/gopt/logs\")\r\n  -o, --output string    输出格式：table 或 json (default \"table\")\r\n      --save             是否保存输出结果到文件\r\n\r\nUse \"gopt [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\r\n"]
